---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - WordSolver" description="WordSolver privacy policy. Learn how we handle your data, cookies, and personal information on our color puzzle solver website.">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container">
    <span class="hero-badge">Legal</span>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: January 2025</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="container" style="padding-bottom:3rem;">
    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>What Data We Collect</h2>
      <p>WordSolver does not collect personal data. We do not require accounts, we do not ask for email addresses, and we do not track individual users across sessions. The solvers run entirely in your browser — your guesses, percentages, game state, and answers never leave your device. No data is sent to our servers during gameplay or solver use.</p>
      <p>We use standard web analytics (anonymous page views) to understand which pages are most visited and how the site performs overall. This data is aggregated and cannot be linked to individual users. We do not use advertising trackers, social media pixels, or any third-party tracking scripts beyond basic analytics.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>WordSolver uses minimal cookies for essential site functionality only. We do not use advertising cookies, marketing cookies, or third-party tracking cookies. Any cookies set by the site are limited to maintaining your preferences (like dark mode settings) and ensuring the solvers work correctly during a single session. No cookie data is shared with third parties.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages, which may process basic request data (IP address, browser type) as part of content delivery. Cloudflare's privacy policy governs that processing. We do not share any user data with Cloudflare beyond what is necessary for serving the website. We do not integrate with any other third-party services that collect personal information.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Since we do not collect personal data, there is nothing to retain. Game state and solver inputs exist only in your browser's memory and are lost when you close the tab or navigate away. If you want a record of your solver session, take a screenshot before closing the page.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, email us at hello@wordsolver.tech. We review and update this policy periodically. The "last updated" date at the top reflects the most recent revision.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
